## Prerequisites

- Node {{node_version}} (`.nvmrc` pinned)
- pnpm 9+
- Azure CLI (`az`) for deploys
- GitHub CLI (`gh`) for repo operations

## Quick Start

```bash
pnpm install
cp .env.example .env.local
# fill in .env.local values
pnpm dev
```

## Commands

```bash
pnpm dev           # run locally
pnpm test          # run tests
pnpm lint          # biome check
pnpm format        # biome format --write
pnpm typecheck     # tsc --noEmit
pnpm build         # production build
```

## Deploy

```bash
pnpm deploy:dev    # see infra/deploy.sh
```

Infrastructure is managed via Bicep + AVM composition. See `infra/README.md`.

